<https://n2t.net/ark:/27023/4eaa2076c3ac9697490338a95d3cf8e7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://colonialcollections.nl/schema#HeritageObject> .
<https://n2t.net/ark:/27023/4eaa2076c3ac9697490338a95d3cf8e7> <https://colonialcollections.nl/schema#identifier> "nf%201309-10" .
